{"assignees":[],"author":{"is_bot":true,"login":"app/github-actions"},"body":"Review the README for minor spelling, grammar, or formatting issues and submit a small cleanup PR.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- Keep the pull request focused.\n- Include a short summary of the change.\n- Link this issue in the pull request description.\n\n/bounty $50","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABEsRbuw","author":{"login":"algora-pbc"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## 💎 $59 bounty [• xevrion-v2](https://algora.io/xevrion-v2)\n### Steps to solve:\n1. **Start working**: Comment `/attempt #2` with your implementation plan\n2. **Submit work**: Create a pull request including `/claim #2` in the PR body to claim the bounty\n3. **Receive payment**: 100% of the bounty is received 2-5 days post-reward. [Make sure you are eligible for payouts](https://algora.io/docs/payments#supported-countries-regions)\n\n### ❗ Important guidelines:\n- To claim a bounty, you need to **provide a short demo video** of your changes in your pull request\n- If anything is unclear, **ask for clarification** before starting as this will help avoid potential rework\n- Low quality AI PRs will not receive review and will be closed\n- Do not ask to be assigned unless you've contributed before\n\nThank you for contributing to xevrion-v2/agent-playground!","createdAt":"2026-06-03T06:52:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/2#issuecomment-4609825723","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABEsRtQA","author":{"login":"xevrion-v2"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"/bounty $50","createdAt":"2026-06-03T06:52:55Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/2#issuecomment-4609830208","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABEsRuvQ","author":{"login":"algora-pbc"},"authorAssoci