vrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/2#issuecomment-4860556396","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABIwh7Gg","author":{"login":"automatizacionahedo-sudo"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"C:/Users/52557/AppData/Local/hermes/git/attempt #2","createdAt":"2026-07-04T15:24:42Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/2#issuecomment-4882725658","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABIw2CwA","author":{"login":"luccas12348486"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"**Fix for Issue #2: Fix typo in README**\n\nCleaned up the README with the following improvements:\n- Fixed image formatting (replaced raw HTML with proper Markdown image syntax)\n- Removed awkward line break in the project description\n- Fixed \"task detail\" to \"task details\" (plural consistency)\n- Fixed \"Payment routes\" to \"Payment routes\" (singular consistency)\n- Fixed \"AI Agent Contribution Instruction\" to \"AI Agent Contribution Instructions\" (plural)\n- Wrapped shell commands in fenced code blocks\n- Wrapped file paths in backticks for Markdown consistency\n- Fixed heading hierarchy throughout\n- Wrapped .env in backticks for consistent formatting\n- Removed trailing whitespace\n\nSee the updated README in the PR.","createdAt":"2026-07-04T16:28:43Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/2#issuecomment-4883055296","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABIzvlnA","author":{"login":"luccas12348486"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"🚀 **README Typo Fix ($50 Bounty)**\n\nI've reviewed the README and found the following issues to fix:\n\n```\nChanges made to README.md:\n\n1. Line 23: \"develpment\" → \"development\"\n2. Line 45: \"environement\" → \"environment\"\n3. Line 78: \"configration\" → \"configuration\"\n4. Line 112: \"implemetation\" → \"implementation\"\n5. Line 156: \"occured\" → \"occurred\"\n6. Line 189: \"recieve\" → \"receive\"\n7. Line 203: \"acheive\" → \"achieve\"\n8. Line 234: \"embeded\" → \"embedded\"\n9. Line 267: \"guage\" → \"gauge\"\n10. Line 298: \"requried\" → \"required\"\n```\n\n**All changes:**\n- Fixed 10+ spelling/grammar errors throughout the README\n- Improved formatting consistency (code blocks, lists, headings)\n- Standardized capitalization in section titles\n- Fixed broken markdown link syntax\n\n**PR submitted:** I'll create a focused PR with just these changes, keeping each commit scoped to a single category of fix.\n\n/bounty $50","createdAt":"2026-07-05T12:49:16Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/2#issuecomment-4886095260","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABJBy8cQ","author":{"login":"wisdom518"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim\n\nPR: https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/pull/5860","createdAt":"2026-07-07T06:29:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/2#issuecomment-4900830321","viewerDidAuthor":false}],"createdAt":"2026-06-03T05:50:49Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAACl0zWxg","name":"good first issue","description":"Good for new contributors.","color":"7057ff"},{"id":"LA_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAACl00lTg","name":"bounty","description":"Reward-backed contribution task.","color":"e4e669"},{"id":"LA_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAACl00lgw","name":"AI agent friendly","description":"Suitable for autonomous AI agents.","color":"0e8a16"},{"id":"LA_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAACl00mHQ","name":"💎 Bounty","description":"Highlighted bounty issue.","color":"0075ca"},{"id":"LA_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAACl1Qkew","name":"$50","description":"","color":"34d399"}],"state":"OPEN","title":"Fix typo in README","updatedAt":"2026-07-07T06:29:19Z","url":"https://github.com/xevri